# The coverage collector writes its report beside the test project. It is a
# measurement of one run rather than something a reader of the tree needs, and
# the run that produced it keeps it as an artifact.
coverage.json

# Stryker writes one directory per mutation run, holding the report and the
# mutated copies of the tree it built. It is the output of one measurement and
# the run that produced it keeps the report as an artifact.
StrykerOutput/
